{"1576680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zoe and the Cursed Dreamer", "steam_appid": 1576680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy sandbox RPG where saving the world is <i>someone else’s</i> job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoe and the Cursed Dreamer is a charming open-world RPG with a dark twist. Build your home, befriend strange villagers, and explore a world unraveling as a tyrannical demon god awakens from banishment. You’re not the chosen one to save this world, but you may end up sponsoring whoever is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy property, build a home, or become a landlord.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet strange characters. Gods, war-mice, a magic talking cat named Mad Catter, and a pig named Truffles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore corrupted forests, giant mushroom caves, and lands scarred by an old divine battle. (Maybe find a nice spot to go fishing.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest and grow your influence. Play a passive economic run where you invest in the ones doing the fighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich worldbuilding and lore. Meet gods who actively meddle in the world, ambitious guilds and factions, and a talking sign that maybe knows too much.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy sandbox RPG where saving the world is <i>someone else’s</i> job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoe and the Cursed Dreamer is a charming open-world RPG with a dark twist. Build your home, befriend strange villagers, and explore a world unraveling as a tyrannical demon god awakens from banishment. You’re not the chosen one to save this world, but you may end up sponsoring whoever is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy property, build a home, or become a landlord.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet strange characters. Gods, war-mice, a magic talking cat named Mad Catter, and a pig named Truffles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore corrupted forests, giant mushroom caves, and lands scarred by an old divine battle. (Maybe find a nice spot to go fishing.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest and grow your influence. Play a passive economic run where you invest in the ones doing the fighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich worldbuilding and lore. Meet gods who actively meddle in the world, ambitious guilds and factions, and a talking sign that maybe knows too much.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You are not the chosen one.. just another villager. Explore a cozy sandbox RPG where you can become a world-renowned cheesemonger, meet quirky characters, and guide them through the dark and desperate times ahead… or not. The world moves on, with or without you.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1576680/f147b5fbdff25de82489fe7974e36c31645249c1/header.jpg?t=1772724995", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1576680/b66d1bd19a21abf16a9f391d22183bc4cf8d41e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772724995", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1576680/b66d1bd19a21abf16a9f391d22183bc4cf8d41e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772724995", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or Later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory, shader model 3.0+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, 